8. API routes (/api, /ws, /healthz, /readyz) correctly in navigateFallbackDenylist — no changes needed
9. runtimeCaching only targets external fonts + tiles — API calls NOT cached ✓

=== REASONING ===
Fix approach:
1. Add skipWaiting: true + clientsClaim: true + cleanupOutdatedCaches: true to workbox config
   → New SW activates immediately, takes control of all tabs, cleans up old cache entries
2. Replace ReloadPrompt with auto-reload countdown (3s) + "Reload Now" button
   → Remove dismiss button (no reason to stay on old version)
   → Add i18n for all strings
   → Replace inline CSS vars with Tailwind classes (text-white/90, text-white/50)
   → Remove raw <button>, only use shared Button component
3. Keep 5-minute update check interval for catching updates during long sessions
4. API caching exclusion already correct — no changes needed

